            <div xml:id="m-b3ba985d-fcc6-4f1c-a4c0-bc133690e7f0">
              <lg xml:id="m-b9e9a78e-bf27-4779-85e7-98c242db00ae">
                <l xml:id="m-df4aa9c0-6dca-483f-90ad-500984eae5f4" facs="#m-e8826f05-c64d-412b-a1dd-37cc777de296" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-13920859-93b6-4cb7-8db7-8365823286ad" facs="#m-83e0b6ef-6f24-40c7-8fd5-4a3b7abba637" label="ambiguous">220</l><l xml:id="m-b1240964-5a20-45c4-a416-11a5257c1fa1" facs="#m-5a5f5674-3d7f-418f-bbb9-860f8c08f697" label="ambiguous">Psalm 19.</l><l xml:id="m-65f2cd22-7490-4e34-a70c-9cb6e69e41ff" facs="#m-99ca546d-32db-43f8-bb8c-8a3398a13358" label="lyrics-like">1. Exáudi-at te Dóminus in dí-e tribula-ti-6- nis: “ pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf49d10d-3dce-4666-852b-895648a91eb7" facs="#m-c6634e48-141a-4702-bb9c-9ecffc1f5220" label="lyrics-like">tegat te nómen Dé-i Já-cob.</l><l xml:id="m-037f2c11-f283-4fb3-bf4c-0bacb08c4dc5" facs="#m-832b5f49-aff5-4c47-a435-3038ec15f5af" label="lyrics-like">2. Mittat tibi auxilium de sáncto:* et de Sion tueâtur te.</l><l xml:id="m-2ca94688-d41b-48ab-b413-c815c7f78bdd" facs="#m-c11570d7-2144-4c0a-a466-ae78bb4c72b6" label="lyrics-like">3. Mémor sit ómnis sacrificit túi :* et holocáustum túum pingue fiat.</l><l xml:id="m-67cfbf9f-d99c-4304-9c3f-f97eea72cee9" facs="#m-55542ea9-0d15-4fc0-9efe-d3f16ec48ece" label="lyrics-like">4. Tribuat tibi secúndum cor túum: “ et ómne consilium túum con¬</l><l xml:id="m-54360c9e-4af4-4b4b-83e7-28486b0e4afe" facs="#m-96b16072-3e93-4bd5-b696-4a60f834a44f" label="ambiguous">firmet.</l><l xml:id="m-5ce138bf-43a6-48ce-8968-d493bcf89d5b" facs="#m-e51a2fe8-86a7-4b55-a47d-a8f71e755edb" label="lyrics-like">5. Laetábimur in salutári túo:“et in nómine Déi nóstri magnifieá¬</l><l xml:id="m-90f1db14-e01a-45be-b406-8254453ad7a6" facs="#m-18b06767-5be6-4a6c-942e-1499724bf2e8" label="ambiguous">bimur.</l><l xml:id="m-8dba7fc7-e00c-4cd7-8dd2-938f9b1714d5" facs="#m-420d3186-21e9-4477-80b0-a3f00cb88ba5" label="lyrics-like">6. Impleat Dóminus ómnes petitiónes túas: * nunc cognóvi quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0d55225-1a72-4ff6-a245-ebf32418a5eb" facs="#m-ae65c77c-e96b-4f0c-82a1-60fc04fe5038" label="lyrics-like">niam sálvum fécit Dóminus Christum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-bd5bb029-18e9-4e2c-b390-1d598bc07ea0" facs="#m-05405d12-3a4e-4334-bd9c-1fd678337b61" label="lyrics-like">7. Exáudiet illum de caélo sáncto súo:*in potentátibus sálus</l><l xml:id="m-d24dd92c-5cb3-4d87-b785-30f24f83a4b5" facs="#m-e77bf1fb-e84b-4698-a6d7-943c8da1e0ed" label="lyrics-like">déxterde éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-63442b84-2db1-41b9-8665-f30afbd0c648" facs="#m-65fee561-f6e4-4b11-9227-d600a2db0734" label="lyrics-like">8. Hi in cúrribus, et hi in équis:*nos autem in nómine Dómini Déi</l><l xml:id="m-96c03fe4-2e0c-4385-8c13-3e641a71bf93" facs="#m-6198ba40-5482-4b55-9cab-e1b4c7337532" label="lyrics-like">nóstri invoeábimus.</l><l xml:id="m-fc5b5acb-31e2-4cc4-81da-fe4b2c6446f2" facs="#m-eb16fdd9-e4d3-43d6-9175-0e1c42350e34" label="lyrics-like">9. Ipsi obligáti sunt, et cecidérunt: *nos autem surréximus, et</l><l xml:id="m-51924b8b-0434-4475-bb57-7ddf5a352d14" facs="#m-c75a7ef0-596c-4b26-b2a8-a667b9492e64" label="lyrics-like">erécti súmus.</l><l xml:id="m-858ee298-ff97-4be3-96e7-1d5cd419ec1e" facs="#m-817bc5ec-015a-4694-85c7-bc7173305d98" label="lyrics-like">10. Dómine sálvum fac régem:“et exáudi nos in die qua invocavéri¬</l><l xml:id="m-3404efc1-7420-4741-8db7-ab7e9d97f506" facs="#m-791514c1-4f6d-49df-9ecf-cc8cda6c7c18" label="ambiguous">mus te.</l><l xml:id="m-7f092f8d-cd49-4887-b9c8-a6789780c5e2" facs="#m-4447ea0e-4d11-4e2d-94a3-df5dd1fd6162" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spirttui sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-7d339426-3a04-49c9-b32c-dc945fe48a97" facs="#m-1c6e4871-9a01-454c-90e6-cc5b8c2d37dd" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-406bae85-4aff-404c-8435-3cdefc1043fa" facs="#m-48065c9f-cc76-44a4-8370-b9a78ba9b8fd" label="lyrics-like">lóram. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5c76e9ef-fecd-4ee7-944b-543a5cd9013a" facs="#m-e3e3b25a-7c78-4612-9437-dfda47314423" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-cddfac72-f3dc-4f97-a893-8c2a675ea276" facs="#m-55481ee5-740d-4268-b0de-356bcdd0a3f2" label="ambiguous">5.a</l><l xml:id="m-0701986c-9f88-4f7f-8f3f-75b29400893b" facs="#m-c39bb162-80f2-488e-8e44-a923f56c7afa" label="lyrics-like">Arátur “nóbis mén-sa Dómi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-fd856a26-81d4-42b3-ad60-41f62e9d485f" facs="#m-c7161fbe-abdf-449f-89ae-a288f14cb1cd" label="lyrics-like">advér-sus</l><l xml:id="m-562a393c-bcb3-48b7-b582-9a14c85790cc" facs="#m-4e2be688-70fe-470d-9798-08d8a96637a3" label="lyrics-like">ómnes qui tríbu-lant nos.</l><l xml:id="m-a16cd394-e72b-42dd-89db-eb961159849c" facs="#m-2e58c606-91a9-4fa3-adb1-c4ef7c18d82d" label="ambiguous">Psalm 22.</l><l xml:id="m-f1b53136-5fc2-4bf9-a5cb-668802b60a2a" facs="#m-0ed3ad28-99e2-426d-ba66-8d82920aec3b" label="lyrics-like">1. Dóminus régit me, et nihil mí-hi dé-erit:" in lóco pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-16dd5149-1b9a-4635-8579-ad338cbb480a" facs="#m-79c0d07a-2f17-4d36-a276-0e60572a0367" label="lyrics-like">scu-ae ibi me col-locá¬ vit.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
